   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Checking what you hear",
     "texto": [
      "On a call you can say **Kan du gjenta det, er du snill?** («Could you repeat that, please?») or **Kan du snakke litt saktere?** («Could you speak a little more slowly?»). To confirm a number: **Mener du 482 16 390?** («Do you mean…?»).",
      "To ask whether someone is available: **Er Kari tilgjengelig?**. If not, offer a concrete action: **Kan jeg legge igjen en beskjed?**. In these questions the conjugated verb usually comes before the subject."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
